{
 "about": "Which text is a [[wikilink]] (family: twin parsers, hunter [notes] 2026-10-31, toimprove 320). `links` are the expected targets in order (Obsidian). The reading view (src/notes/wikilinkContract.test.ts) and the native parser (tests/wikilink_contract.rs) run these rows. `drift` marks a side that disagrees today; its test asserts the row still disagrees, so it turns red when fixed.",
